    <x:String x:Key="Hint_Pen">{0} · click: anchor · drag: curve · drag handle: adjust (Alt: break symmetry) · Alt+click anchor: corner · Ctrl+drag: move anchor · Enter/double-click: close path · {1}: make selection · Ctrl+Shift+Enter: add to selection · line thickness: options bar · line color: settings · Esc: cancel.</x:String>
